@startuml UC-71 Delete Content Comment - Sequence Diagram
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title 2.10.2.9 UC-71 Delete Content Comment — Sequence Diagram

actor Teacher
participant ":CommunityHubDetailPage" as UI
participant ":HubContentController" as CTL
participant ":HubCommentService" as SVC
participant ":HubCommentRepository" as REPO
database DB

autonumber
Teacher ->> UI : Click "Delete" on one of their own comments
activate UI
UI -->> Teacher : Show the delete confirmation dialog warning that the replies below go with it (MSG09)

opt the user cancels the deletion
  Teacher ->> UI : Close the confirmation dialog
  UI -->> Teacher : Keep the comment in the discussion, change nothing stored, and end the use case
end

Teacher ->> UI : Click "Delete comment" to confirm
UI ->> UI : confirmDeleteComment()
UI ->> CTL : DELETE /api/hub/comments/{commentId}
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : delete(commentId)
activate SVC

SVC ->> REPO : findById(commentId)
activate REPO
REPO ->> DB : SELECT * FROM hub_content_comments WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB -->> REPO : row / none
deactivate DB
REPO -->> SVC : HubComment
deactivate REPO

alt the comment is missing or hidden, or the user is not its author
  SVC -->> CTL : ResourceNotFoundException / ForbiddenOperationException
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 404 / 403
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG25 and leave the discussion unchanged

else the user owns the comment
  SVC ->> REPO : deleteById(commentId)
  activate REPO
  REPO ->> DB : DELETE FROM hub_content_comments WHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB -->> REPO : Deleted, direct replies removed by ON DELETE CASCADE
  deactivate DB
  REPO -->> SVC : void
  deactivate REPO
  SVC -->> CTL : void
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 204 No Content
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG10 and the discussion without the deleted comment and its replies
end

deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
@enduml
